se. If $(x,y)$ is in the first quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)>0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is positive for any point $(x,y)$ in the first quadrant.\n\n- Statement “At every point in the third quadrant, the slope of the slope field is negative” is true. If $(x,y)$ is in the third quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)<0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is negative for any point $(x,y)$ in the third quadrant."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564849 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cab2d62-587d-52bf-b070-18c833aa66fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564882} {:answer/id #uuid "97de6a64-6253-5e1a-9626-15e1bdaac965" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564889}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "97de6a64-6253-5e1a-9626-15e1bdaac965" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564889} :answer-field/id #uuid "13ba05b4-64f9-574f-9775-51875c8dfc16" :answer-field/key "At every point in the first quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564854} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "328b011b-8c8f-52ab-8d81-8cc811b010dc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564864} {:answer/id #uuid "74584873-7102-5114-a4bd-1bf7395de72e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564880}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "328b011b-8c8f-52ab-