.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is positive for any point $(x,y)$ in the first quadrant.\n\n- Statement “At every point in the second quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive” is false. If $(x,y)$ is in the second quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)<0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is negative for any point $(x,y)$ in the second quadrant.\n\n- Statement “At every point in the fourth quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive” is true. If $(x,y)$ is in the fourth quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)>0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is positive for any point $(x,y)$ in the fourth quadrant."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564900 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "265a819f-5dd1-5360-b2cc-837073c24cb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564859} {:answer/id #uuid "bb5ceff8-8b6a-59c5-88af-a3eda0df0d50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564901}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb5ceff8-8b6a-59c5-88af-a3eda0df0d50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564901} :answer-field/id #uuid "54d6432d-dc51-56f4-9489-d396d431c572" :answer-field/key "At every point in the fourth quadrant, the slope of the slope field is negative" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564871} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c18ee1a2-68d1-50ad-9de8-daec70285941" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564905} {:answer/id #uuid "d361